<title>USA: Centigram says CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Centigram says CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centigram Communications Corp said Anthony Muller resigned as senior vice president of operations and administration and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Muller, who joined Centigram in 1990, will leave this month to join another company.</p>
<p>George Sollman, president and chief executive officer, will serve as acting chief financial officer while a search is conducted for a successor.</p>
